contract design"],"flags":[],"profile":"<<<DATA\nElena Bose. Builder focused on sentence-encoder serving.\nElena studied at Carrow National Institute and has 8 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: pgvector and FAISS retrieval, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, dense passage ranking, REST contract design.\nProjects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Vector search","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"Python","cosine":0.63,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on sentence-encoder serving."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Postgres","cosine":0.63,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline","cosine":0.67,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on sentence-encoder serving."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"API design","cosine":0.62,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."}]}},"seq":122,"ts":1793425433311},{"runId":"run_mvvz61dk","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00386,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":5478,"usage":{"input":32965,"output":1076,"cacheRead":2814,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":123,"ts":1793425438792},{"runId":"run_mvvz61dk","kind":"reason","node":"search_candidates","payload":{"n":21,"text":"Only Hana is fully evidenced and 5 calls remain; a reformulated query pairing Python service