rieval, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, dense passage ranking, REST contract design.\nProjects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Vector search","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"Python","cosine":0.63,"bestSentence":"Builder focused on sentence-encoder serving."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Postgres","cosine":0.63,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"API design","cosine":0.62,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."}]}},"seq":74,"ts":1793425927716},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00165,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":1986,"usage":{"input":14474,"output":341,"cacheRead":2861,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":75,"ts":1793425929705},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":12,"text":"c066 has no explicit Python sentence; the FastAPI gateway serving sentence is the best implicit evidence for m2.","source":"llm"},"seq":76,"ts":1793425929705},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb9