act design","FastAPI services","PostgreSQL query tuning","pgvector and FAISS retrieval"],"flags":[],"profile":"<<<DATA\nYuki Haddad. Engineer who likes dense passage ranking.\nYuki studied at Pinecrest Community College and has 9 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, FastAPI services, PostgreSQL query tuning, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.\nProjects: Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.\nDATA>>>","requirementHints":[{"requirementId":"m1","requirement":"Vector search","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Engineer who likes dense passage ranking."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"Python","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Projects: Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Postgres","cosine":0.59,"bestSentence":"Engineer who likes dense passage ranking."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline","cosine":0.68,"bestSentence":"Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"API design","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Projects: Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints."}]}},"seq":101,"ts":1793425938149},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00243,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":2202,"usage":{"input":21995,"output":412,"cacheRead":2861,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":102,"ts":1793425940354},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":17,"text":"c122 needs m1 vector search; the FAISS index over 40M descriptions with latency cut is direct evidence.","source":"llm"},"seq":103,"ts":1793425940354},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"tool_call","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":17,"name":"cite_evidence","input":{"candidate_id":"c122","requirement_id":"m1","quote":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms."},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":104,"ts":1793425940354},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cached":true,"costUsd":0,"wouldCost":0.0000794,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"seq":105,"ts":1793425940369},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"input":{"sentence":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.","requirement":"Vector search"},"rationale":"The sentence describes building a FAISS index (a vector search library) over 40M product descriptions and measurably improving p95 lookup latency, which is concrete hands-on evidence of vector search work."},"seq":106,"ts":1793425940369},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"tool_result","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":17,"name":"cite_evidence","ok":true,"result":{"accepted":true,"strength":"strong","decidedBy":"claude","confidence":0.97,"span":[578,674],"evidenceCount":1,"mustHavesCovered":"1/3"}},"seq":107,"ts":1793425940369},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00259,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":2294,"usage":{"input":23317,"output":452,"cacheRead":2861,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":108,"ts":1793425942666},{"runId":"run_mvvzhb93","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":18,"text":"c122 needs m2 Python; the Python ingestion and query services sentenc