ion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints."}]}},"seq":47,"ts":1793426100091},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00115,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":2835,"usage":{"input":7984,"output":639,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":48,"ts":1793426102928},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":6,"text":"c122 has FAISS index and Python service sentences; Postgres support is only a strengths-list mention, so I'm citing that sentence and will see if it holds.","source":"llm"},"seq":49,"ts":1793426102928},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"tool_call","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":6,"name":"cite_evidence","input":{"candidate_id":"c122","citations":[{"requirement_id":"m1","quote":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms."},{"requirement_id":"m2","quote":"Wrote the Python ingestion and query services around the index, with asyncio workers and typed FastAPI endpoints."},{"requirement_id":"m3","quote":"She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, FastAPI services, PostgreSQL query tuning, pgvector and FAISS retrieval."}]},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":50,"ts":1793426102928},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cached":true,"costUsd":0,"wouldCost":0.0000794,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5"},"seq":51,"ts":1793426102942},{"runId":"run_mvvzl4ex","kind":"decision","node":"decide","payload":{"task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.97,"costUsd":0,"input":{"sentence":"Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms.","requirement":"Vector search"},"rationale":"The sentence describes building a FAISS index (a vector search library) over 40M product descriptions and measurably improving p95 lookup latency, which is co