ctualUsd":0.000076,"ts":1793425154288,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"Vector search"}},{"runId":"run_mvvz0rpn","task":"requirement_support","by":"claude","label":"yes","confidence":0.85,"costUsd":0.0000965,"counterfactualUsd":0.0000965,"ts":1793425158512,"input":{"sentence":"Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set.","requirement":"Postgres"}},{"runId":"run_mvvz0rpn","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425161524,"input":{"text":"Neha Okafor. Firmware Engineer. Passionate about vector search, embeddings pipeline and semantic search. Keywords: vector search, embeddings pipeline, semantic search, Postgres, Python, API design. vector search, embeddings pipeline.\nNeha studied at Westbrook University and has 2 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: vector search, embeddings pipeline, semantic search, Postgres, Python, API design.\nProjects: Brought up a new sensor board with an RTOS. Reduced idle power draw by 40% in C firmware."}},{"runId":"run_mvvz0rpn","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425166122,"input":{"text":"Yuki Haddad. Engineer who likes dense passage ranking.\nYuki studied at Pinecrest Community College and has 9 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, FastAPI services, PostgreSQL query tuning, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.\nProjects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams."}},{"runId":"run_mvvz0rpn","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425170761,"input":{"text":"Ishita Nguyen. Builder focused on pgvector and faiss retrieval.\nIshita studied at Westbrook University and has 11 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: REST contract design, dense passage ranking, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, pgvector and FAISS retrieval.\nProjects: Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms."}},{"runId":"run_mvvz0rpn","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425177172,"input":{"text":"Elena Bose. Builder focused on sentence-encoder serving.\nElena studied at Carrow National Institute and has 8 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: pgvector and FAISS retrieval, sentence-encoder serving, FastAPI services, dense passage ranking, REST contract design.\nProjects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set. Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Designed REST contracts for a dense passage ranking service used by three internal teams."}},{"runId":"run_mvvz0rpn","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425184158,"input":{"text":"Hana Tanaka. Builder focused on dense passage ranking.\nHana studied at Greenhill Institute and has 6 years of experience. She would describe her strengths as: dense passage ranking, PostgreSQL query tuning, FastAPI services.\nProjects: Built a FAISS index over 40M product descriptions and cut p95 lookup latency from 900ms to 60ms. Served a fine-tuned sentence encoder behind a FastAPI gateway with batched inference and warm caches. Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."}},{"runId":"run_mvvz0rpn","task":"injection_check","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425190046,"input":{"text":"Yuki Nair. Backend Engineer with 6 years of experience in EdTech.\nYuki holds a MSc from Carrow National Institute. She would describe her strengths as: Docker, Databases, Unit Testing, Python, Java, REST APIs, Git, JavaScript.\nProjects: Wrote the Python integration layer and its JavaScript test harness for a partner API. Migrated a monolith's order module to a standalone JavaScript service with zero-downtime cutover.\nExperience: Delivered results using structured workflows and clear communication. Collaborated with stakeholders to define needs and execute tasks. Maintained reporting and documentation to support team performance."}},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425266606,"input":{"line":"Senior Backend Engineer, Retrieval Platform"}},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425266614,"input":{"line":"We are building a retrieval platform."}},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425266626,"input":{"line":"You will own our vector search stack and the embeddings pipeline that feeds it, ship semantic search features, tune Postgres, write Python services, and lead API design for internal consumers."}},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local","label":"no","confidence":0.9,"costUsd":0,"counterfactualUsd":0.00009,"ts":1793425266632,"input":{"line":"Must have: vector search, Python, Postgres."}},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt","task":"discriminatory_clause","by":"local